{{!
    @template mod_presenterai/policy_callout

    What happens to the recording the learner is about to make: whether it is
    deleted, whether they can keep a copy, and, when pruning applies, which
    older recording the next one will replace.

    Body text in reading order with a real heading, before the record button
    (design section 11, rules 4 and 5): no role="note", no alert role, no
    modal and no tooltip, because a screen reader user finds a notice by
    jumping headings and a sighted user reads it on the way to the button.

    body is HTML: it carries the site name through format_string and, for the
    no-download variants, the support contact link.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * variant - One of keep_dl, keep_nodl, delete_dl, delete_nodl.
    * heading - The heading sentence.
    * body - The body, HTML.
    * prunewarning - The pruning warning, or empty.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "variant": "delete_nodl",
        "heading": "Your recording is deleted after 30 days, and cannot be downloaded.",
        "body": "This recording is deleted automatically 30 days after you make it.",
        "prunewarning": "Recording again will delete your oldest recording, made on 1 October 2026. Your score and feedback for it are kept."
    }
}}
<div class="mod-presenterai-callout mod-presenterai-callout-{{variant}} border rounded p-3 mb-3">
    <h4 class="mt-0">{{heading}}</h4>
    <p class="mb-0">{{{body}}}</p>
    {{#prunewarning}}
    <p class="mod-presenterai-prune mt-2 mb-0">{{prunewarning}}</p>
    {{/prunewarning}}
</div>
